message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "ARGUS Morphing Wing RANS Validation Workflow"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-09
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tsb-buchanan/argus-production"
authors:
  - family-names: Buchanan
    given-names: Tyler
    affiliation: Delft University of Technology
abstract: >-
  OpenFOAM-org 12 RANS workflows for validating the OpenVSP/VSPAERO outer-wing
  morphing design study of the ARGUS project: case recipes, HPC mesh and solve
  jobs, trim to target lift, post-processing, run cards, and the validation
  report comparing viscous drag, induced drag, hinge moment, and root bending
  with the vortex-lattice selection.
keywords:
  - morphing wing
  - OpenFOAM
  - RANS
  - CFD validation
  - VSPAERO
